<p>The <code>BreadcrumbList</code> renders an <code>&lt;ol&gt;</code>
  that holds the ancestor trail. It should be used inside a
  <a href="/components/breadcrumb-nav/">BreadcrumbNav</a> so assistive
  tech has a navigation landmark.</p>

<p>See the <a href="/components/breadcrumb-nav/">BreadcrumbNav demo</a>
  for usage.</p>

{# BEGIN generated: examples (bin/generate-examples) #}
<h2>Usage</h2>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>{% raw %}&lt;BreadcrumbNav label="Breadcrumb"&gt;
  &lt;BreadcrumbList&gt;
    &lt;BreadcrumbListItem&gt;
      &lt;BreadcrumbLink href="/"&gt;Home&lt;/BreadcrumbLink&gt;
    &lt;/BreadcrumbListItem&gt;
    &lt;BreadcrumbListItem&gt;
      &lt;BreadcrumbLink href="/health-a-z"&gt;Health A to Z&lt;/BreadcrumbLink&gt;
    &lt;/BreadcrumbListItem&gt;
    &lt;BreadcrumbListItem aria-current="page"&gt;
      Diabetes
    &lt;/BreadcrumbListItem&gt;
  &lt;/BreadcrumbList&gt;
&lt;/BreadcrumbNav&gt;
{% endraw %}</code></pre>
